Subject: Re: How to obtain the 'imputed data' from the FIML estimator? (needed for making QQ plots)
Message-ID: <IBk7L5X-iqY.PTtqJEU-DAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <IBk7L5X-iqY.abZ-PzrCCgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
