Date: Wed, 11 Jul 2018 09:23:46 +0000
Subject: Re: Regression in lavaan and diagnostic tools
Message-ID: <ZTQ-kTAAZ6A.JfJV_x7IDAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <ZTQ-kTAAZ6A.ONfkq-GfDAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
References: <ZTQ-kTAAZ6A.ONfkq-GfDAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
