Hugo

You dont need the std.lv <http://std.lv>=T, the EFA function sets the identification constraints needed for estimation.

When I run this I dont get an error

### run EFA with WLSMV
ef2_irt <- efaUnrotate(data=LC.MT <http://LC.MT>,
                       estimator="wlsmv",
                       nf=2,
                       start = FALSE,

                       ordered =colnames(LC.MT <http://LC.MT>))

summary(ef2_irt, std = TRUE)

Could it be that you dont have the latest version of semTools or lavaan?
This works for me with this session and package versions
