Subject: Re: Partial strong invariance: need help on the model syntax (fixed factor and effects coding)
Message-ID: <1MY-9UXrpAU.EwVwL-wHBgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <1MY-9UXrpAU.TLrlgR2ZBQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
