Subject: Re: bootstrap and significance
Message-ID: <1zeHeDCpqtY.U7LBUTp6BgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <1zeHeDCpqtY.KBjtJHmbBQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
